        "object": "<p>Foreign secretary tells MPs he will try to stop illegal settlements carving up the West Bank</p><p>Ed Miliband has promised to “reset” Britain’s policy on Israel, saying he will try to stop British companies helping build settlements in the West Bank.</p><p>Speaking to the Commons for the first time as foreign secretary, Miliband said he would set out measures to prevent UK involvement in projects such as the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/aug/14/israel-appears-set-to-approve-controversial-settlement-of-3400-homes-in-west-bank\">illegal E1 plan</a>, which critics say would split the West Bank in half.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/01/ed-miliband-promises-reset-of-uk-policy-toward-israel\">Continue reading...</a>"
